  "security_rules": "When the alarm is armed the hall is closed and nobody should be inside, staff included: they disarm before entering. Anything a camera sees moving must be checked by the robot dog unless it is clearly harmless: a light or shadow change, a reflection, a screen, our own robot dog, an insect.",
  "normal_objects": "white walls, square pillars, the ceiling grid, the internal room and its walls, partitions, the display case at the centre, a bench, six tables with chairs, a Formula 1 single-seater and a Nissan 350Z on display, the metal staircase to the upper floor, cameras on pillars and walls.",
